  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    \n    # Find horizontal and vertical lines of 4s\n    hlines = [r for r in range(rows) if all(grid[r][c] == 4 for c in range(cols))]\n    vlines = [c for c in range(cols) if all(grid[r][c] == 4 for r in range(rows))]\n    \n    # Build quadrant boundaries\n    row_bounds = []\n    prev = 0\n    for h in hlines:\n        row_bounds.append((prev, h))\n        prev = h + 1\n    row_bounds.append((prev, rows))\n    \n    col_bounds = []\n    prev = 0\n    for v in vlines:\n        col_bounds.append((prev, v))\n        prev = v + 1\n    col_bounds.append((prev, cols))\n    \n    # Find the non-empty quadrant\n    source = None\n    for rb in row_bounds:\n        for cb in col_bounds:\n            for r in range(rb[0], rb[1]):\n                for c in range(cb[0], cb[1]):\n                    if grid[r][c] != 0:\n                        source = (rb, cb)\n                        break\n                if source: break\n            if source: break\n        if source: break\n    \n    sr, sc = source\n    result = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    for rb in row_bounds:\n        for cb in col_bounds:\n            if (rb[1]-rb[0]) == (sr[1]-sr[0]) and (cb[1]-cb[0]) == (sc[1]-sc[0]):\n                for dr in range(sr[1]-sr[0]):\n                    for dc in range(sc[1]-sc[0]):\n                        result[rb[0]+dr][cb[0]+dc] = grid[sr[0]+dr][sc[0]+dc]\n    \n    return result\n```",
  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    \n    # Find horizontal and vertical lines of 4s\n    hlines = [r for r in range(rows) if all(grid[r][c] == 4 for c in range(cols))]\n    vlines = [c for c in range(cols) if all(grid[r][c] == 4 for r in range(rows))]\n    \n    # Build quadrant boundaries\n    row_bounds = []\n    prev = 0\n    for h in hlines:\n        row_bounds.append((prev, h))\n        prev = h + 1\n    row_bounds.append((prev, rows))\n    \n    col_bounds = []\n    prev = 0\n    for v in vlines:\n        col_bounds.append((prev, v))\n        prev = v + 1\n    col_bounds.append((prev, cols))\n    \n    # Find the non-empty quadrant\n    source = None\n    for rb in row_bounds:\n        for cb in col_bounds:\n            for r in range(rb[0], rb[1]):\n                for c in range(cb[0], cb[1]):\n                    if grid[r][c] != 0:\n                        source = (rb, cb)\n                        break\n                if source: break\n            if source: break\n        if source: break\n    \n    sr, sc = source\n    result = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    for rb in row_bounds:\n        for cb in col_bounds:\n            if (rb[1]-rb[0]) == (sr[1]-sr[0]) and (cb[1]-cb[0]) == (sc[1]-sc[0]):\n                for dr in range(sr[1]-sr[0]):\n                    for dc in range(sc[1]-sc[0]):\n                        result[rb[0]+dr][cb[0]+dc] = grid[sr[0]+dr][sc[0]+dc]\n    \n    return result",
